    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/classic-toy-store/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Classic toy store WordPress Theme is a versatile, visually engaging solution designed for toy retailers and nostalgic collectors. This premium theme is crafted for businesses showcasing an extensive range of products—from classic musical toys, plush toys, and collectible toys to modern favorites such as superhero toys, Disney toys, Marvel toys, and Star Wars toys. Its design evokes the charm of a vintage toy store while seamlessly integrating contemporary features, making it perfect for selling items like Barbie dolls, baby dolls, dollhouses, play kitchens, and pretend play toys. Built with user experience in mind, the theme offers an intuitive layout that highlights product images with vibrant sliders, crisp typography, and interactive galleries. It is designed to accommodate a diverse inventory, including toy instruments, costumes for kids, play tents, ball pits, sand toys, and even electronic learning toys like kids tablets, coding toys, and voice-activated toys. Additionally, it supports niche products such as Nerf guns, laser tag sets, science experiment kits, collectible cards (like Pokémon and Yu-Gi-Oh), and even eco-friendly and sustainable toys. Whether youre displaying classic toys, nostalgic toys, or modern interactive toys, this theme offers robust customization options that allow you to reflect your brands unique personality and drive customer engagement."
    },
